1
00:00:00,093 --> 00:00:00,889
Dulu,

2
00:00:00,889 --> 00:00:02,222
Eropa yakin...

3
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:04,269
cenderawasih kita tak punya kaki!

4
00:00:04,269 --> 00:00:05,481
5 abad lalu,

5
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:07,444
kulitnya dibawa dari Maluku...

6
00:00:07,444 --> 00:00:08,525
tanpa kaki.

7
00:00:08,525 --> 00:00:10,352
Dikira tak pernah mendarat...

8
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:11,685
terbang seumur hidup,

9
00:00:11,685 --> 00:00:12,907
hanya minum embun.

10
00:00:12,907 --> 00:00:14,306
Ia pun dijuluki...

11
00:00:14,306 --> 00:00:15,296
burung surga.

12
00:00:15,296 --> 00:00:16,463
Ke mana kakinya?

13
00:00:16,463 --> 00:00:17,565
Ternyata...

14
00:00:17,565 --> 00:00:18,713
sudah dipotong,

15
00:00:18,713 --> 00:00:19,963
sebelum dijual!

16
00:00:19,963 --> 00:00:21,343
Tapi sampai sekarang,

17
00:00:21,343 --> 00:00:22,491
nama ilmiahnya...

18
00:00:22,491 --> 00:00:24,130
Paradisaea apoda.

19
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:25,000
Artinya:

20
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,935
burung surga tanpa kaki!

21
00:00:26,935 --> 00:00:28,481
Pernah lihat cenderawasih langsung?

22
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:29,981
Jawab di komentar!
